{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"评注　陈翀大师\r\n广东吕钦(先负)江苏王斌\r\n(2007年3月24日弈于淄博)\r\n顺炮直车对横车\r\n这是本次比赛决赛阶段争夺第5名的一场较量。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9i8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8d8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9a7","comment":"顺炮横车屯边马布阵是王斌的拿手布局，屡屡在大赛中使用，且效果良好。此次祭出杀手锏，自然信心十足。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2f4","comment":"红方跃马出击，着法积极。较为含蓄的下法是走仕六进五。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0b0","comment":"在2006年个人赛中黑龙江赵国荣曾经执红面对王斌时走车二进五，黑则车1平2，车九平八，车2进6，车二平六，车4平6，马四进五，马7进5，炮五进四，士6进5，黑方布局满意。因为有了前车之鉴，红方改走出车的变化。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9b9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2b6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e8","comment":"黑方补士后，阵型较为扎实，而红方的双马均有被黑车追逐的可能，红方难以同时兼顾。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0h5","comment":"此时红方走炮五平三、兵七进一的效果都不理想。进车从感觉上来讲要优于前两种变化。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d8d2","comment":"这也是王斌的改进之着，比车4进4的效果要好。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0b2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e7e3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3e4","comment":"下到此时，黑方已相当满意。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b6b7","comment":"红方进炮并无实质性意义，反而白送黑方一步棋。由于是快棋，红方对现在的局面更加难以把握，心理上的压力也很大。此着不如改走马四进五，兑子后争取到简明的局面，能看得更清楚一些。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d2d3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2b4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d3c3","comment":"黑方看到红方行棋效率较低，抓紧时间开始扫荡兵行线。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2a1","comment":"红方如改走车八平五，车2进2，马四进五，马7进5，车五进二，象3进5，红方形势仍然艰难。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3a3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c0a2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a3a2","comment":"黑方饱餐一顿，红方也没有任何反击手段，走到这里我想红方也感到非常无奈了","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5b5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e4c4","comment":"黑方一着平炮，使得红方疲于应付。由于红方之前亏损过大，局势变得更加艰难。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a1c0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c4g4","comment":"黑方连削带打取得了丰厚的物质力量，下面的工作就是兑子了。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b4b0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a2a5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c0d2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b5a5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a6a5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f4d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7b8","comment":"红方如改走马六进七，黑则炮5进5，相三进五，车2进1，红方并无后续手段。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a7c8","comment":"黑方退马以防红马六进七捉车的手段。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2g2","comment":"黑方物质优势雄厚，红方只能回避兑子以求变化。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6e5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c9e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6c6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d2f3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e5e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f3h4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c8d6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6i6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c5d3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0b1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5c5","comment":"","def